      "message": "Hi Ryan, would you like to help us understand where we get the system llvm version from? Also is this llvm package only intended to be used by dawn?\n\nIf you are ok with what comes with bot, then we can use the llvm in the image directly? Am I missing anything?",
      "revId": "f62995b6aae425f0b359c73cb2923cfec80c42be",
