      "writtenOn": "2026-06-17T20:19:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Marking as unresolved to increase visibility.\n\nFrom the associated bug, though:\n\n\u003e Turning on the Tint + Mesa fuzzers on in CF bounced, due to the specific bots not having a version of llvm-dev installed which supplies a number of artifacts needed by the Mesa/Meson build.\n...\nThis current PoR is to attempt re-packaging the needed parts of the official LLVM release into a tarbal and uploading that to the GCS bucket, and reworking the Tint + Mesa fuzzer build rules to fetch and use this everywhere that the build is enable instead of implicitly depending on the system installed version.",
      "parentUuid": "761cef55_76fd9dad",
      "revId": "f62995b6aae425f0b359c73cb2923cfec80c42be",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d16786af_c901d13c",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000250
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-17T20:46:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for raising the visibility, I had missed this comment.\n\nThis package will be also need to be used by ClusterFuzz, in a Chromium checkout, so that it can build the Tint + Mesa fuzzers.\n\nThe bot image as-is do not include the llvm-dev package that I need to my understanding, which is why my original CL for enabling the Tint + Mesa fuzzers needed to be reverted, since the build was failing.\n\nA system package llvm-dev install I think would be acceptable here, since Mesa is pretty loose about what version of llvm it needs to link against (I believe it is \u003e\u003d 15 for the features we need).\n\nFrom the original thread, I was mostly concerned about how acceptable it would be to add installing the package into the base OS image for all the bots would be given that it is only really needed for this specific fuzz testing.",
      "parentUuid": "755d7b25_a1d4cf0e",
      "revId": "f62995b6aae425f0b359c73cb2923cfec80c42be",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
